Z||000015||Raydar||10-10-2000||09:44 PM||||I would check the gas tank fill pipe, just in case they decided to "sweeten" your fuel.<BR>But I'm not cynical. Really I'm not.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Raydar<BR>88 Formula T-Top <BR>88 Coupe (soon to receive transplant.)<BR>88 "pretzeled" Formula <P>Out of my mind.<BR>Back in five minutes.||||reg||1
