Z||000033||ur2biteme||10-13-2000||05:08 AM||||at least someone finally took them to the cleaners.  trust me, you're getting revenge for my getting taken to the cleaners.  <P>i probably could have sued the carlot for selling me an unsafe vehicle.  i had a leaking brake caliper on mine when i bought it!  didn't know until i noticed that i was having to add brake fluid way too often- about 6 months after i bought it!  <P>oh well, it's turning into one damn good car.  how many 170k dukes do you know of that had to go that far before starting a preignition rattle?  or 170k dukes for that matter?<P>anyway.  great score!  i hope to find a decent formula or GT someday......<P>------------------<BR>UR2BITEME<BR>'87 econo coupe<BR>170k and a bad fender :(||||reg||1
