Z||000037||mrfiero||10-14-2000||07:42 PM||||Pictures will be coming soon......I'll scan some in tomorrow and will post them by Monday.<P>Silver '88 GT's are rare, but not the rarest.  There were 257 silver GT's built, but only 241 yellows.  The reason silver ones are hard to find is that they were an early production color only.  They quit producing them in Nov. '87.....medium red metallic took its place.  All factory silver '88s are low VIN#'s.....mine is #07125 and was built in Oct. '87.<P>Now if it had factory T-Tops.....that would be one of the the rarest Fieros!<BR> <BR>    ||||reg||10
